<% const writing=nijika_writing(); %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= url_for('atelier/css/editorial-index.css') %>">
<section class="personal-atelier creation-index" aria-label="创作室">
  <header class="creation-heading"><div><p class="index-eyebrow">CC ATELIER / SELECTED WORK</p><h1 tabindex="-1">想法的<br><em>另一种形状。</em></h1><p>写下来的，做出来的，还有正在练习的。</p></div><nav aria-label="创作室页导航"><a href="#creation-works">精选作品 ↓</a><a href="#creation-traces">写作足迹 ↓</a><a href="<%= url_for('about/') %>">关于 CC ↗</a></nav></header>
  <section class="creation-works" id="creation-works" aria-labelledby="creation-works-title"><header class="index-section-heading"><h2 id="creation-works-title">可以打开，也可以动手。</h2><span>01—03 / 作品索引</span></header>
    <article class="creation-main-work"><a class="creation-scene" href="<%= url_for('studio/practice/') %>"><img src="<%= url_for('atelier/images/v5/practice-room.webp') %>" srcset="<%= nijika_art_srcset('/atelier/images/v5/practice-room.webp') %>" sizes="(max-width:700px) 92vw, 60vw" width="1536" height="1024" alt="虹夏在日光排练室练习深蓝鼓组的主题插画" fetchpriority="high"><span>01 / SOUND & PLAY</span></a><div class="creation-work-copy"><p class="index-eyebrow">在浏览器里，练一段节奏</p><h3>鼓谱排练室</h3><p>让谱面变成声音。放慢速度，循环一段，再跟着拍点重新来过。</p><a class="creation-enter" href="<%= url_for('studio/practice/') %>">打开排练室 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details><summary>可以怎样玩？</summary><ol><li>选择一条原创练习，先听节奏。</li><li>调整速度，观察鼓谱与播放位置。</li><li>跟着练习，或导出谱面继续练。</li></ol><a href="<%= url_for('studio/') %>">也可以自己编一段节奏 ↗</a></details></div></article>
    <div class="creation-pair"><article class="creation-small-work creation-code"><div class="creation-code-visual" aria-label="阅读的三个层次：文章、关联、下一篇"><span>02 / READING SYSTEM</span><strong>读一篇。<br>连接下一篇<span>↗</span></strong><div>文章 <i>→</i> 主题关联 <i>→</i> 阅读队列</div></div><div class="creation-small-copy"><h3>CC Atelier</h3><p>把个人网站做成一个能阅读、能探索的地方。</p><a href="<%= url_for('projects/') %>">查看实现与取舍 ↗</a><a href="<%= url_for('notes/') %>#notes-catalog">试试阅读目录 ↗</a></div></article>
    <article class="creation-small-work creation-query"><div class="creation-query-visual"><span>03 / QUERY & VERIFY</span><strong>一个问题，<br>两种查询。</strong><div><span>COUNT(*)</span><span>COUNT(t.id)</span></div></div><div class="creation-small-copy"><h3>SQL 验证台</h3><p>修改查询、运行示例数据，比较答案为什么不同。</p><a href="<%= url_for('research/') %>#sql-lab-title">打开 SQL 教学实验 ↗</a><details><summary>这个实验在比较什么？</summary><p>用小数据检验查询语义，观察空值、关联和边界条件如何改变结果。这里是教学示例。</p></details></div></article></div>
  </section>
  <section class="creation-traces" id="creation-traces" aria-labelledby="creation-traces-title"><div><p class="index-eyebrow">WRITING / 留下的线索</p><h2 id="creation-traces-title">写作足迹</h2><p>按文章发布时间回看。<br>思路与代码，都留在这里。</p><a href="<%= url_for('notes/') %>">进入完整笔记目录 ↗</a></div><% if(!writing.length){ %><p>笔记正在整理中。</p><% } %><ol><% writing.slice(0,5).forEach(post=>{ %><li><time datetime="<%= date_xml(post.date) %>"><%= date(post.date,'YYYY.MM.DD') %></time><a href="<%= url_for(post.path) %>"><%= post.title %><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><% }) %></ol></section>
  <aside class="creation-coda"><span>AFTER HOURS</span><p>技术之外，还有日常。</p><a href="<%= url_for('life/') %>">生活 ↗</a><a href="<%= url_for('guestbook/') %>">留句话 ↗</a></aside>
</section>
